@startuml Activity Diagram
title Remote Worker Flow (ExecutionService, in a pool runspace)

start
:Receive HostName + JobType + Options + ResolvedIp;
note right
  Runs on a RunspaceManager pool thread, never the
  WPF dispatcher. ResolvedIp is the prefetched IP
  (HostResolver), so the worker skips DNS on the
  hot path; each phase gates its own transport
  with BOUNDED port probes (RPC-135 / SMB-445, ~2s)
  before touching the target.
end note

switch (JobType?)
case (Resolve / WarmRunspace)
    :Resolve via the active DC + probe RPC-135;
    note right: HostResolver caches the {Ip, Online}\nverdict (5-min TTL); WarmRunspace just\npre-loads the module graph + assemblies.
case (Scan / UpdateScan)
    :SMB gate -> clear outputLog (+ baseline) ->\ndcu-cli /scan via PsExec (SYSTEM, -r DonutDcu);
    :Live-tail scan.log -> Information stream\n(milestones "N/5" + every line);
case (UpdateApply)
    :Same PsExec path, dcu-cli /applyUpdates\n(watchdog 120m; tail drives the percent bar);
    :On a dropped pipe (233/64/...), recover dcu-cli's
    authoritative return code from apply.log;
    :Flag RebootRequired from dcu code 1/5;
case (Inventory)
    :RPC gate -> CIM/DCOM fast path (15s bound),\nfalling back to the PsExec probe (-r DonutProbe);
case (DiskScan)
    :SMB gate -> deploy + run wiztree64.exe\n(MFT scan, -r DonutDisk, watchdog 20m);
endswitch
note right
  A per-job watchdog (scan 30m / apply 120m /
  probe 10m / disk 20m) kills the psexec client
  past its deadline -> typed RemoteTimeoutException
  instead of a forever-Running job.
end note

:Copy remote artifacts back;
note right
  From the UNC admin share and C:/temp/DONUT
  into %LOCALAPPDATA%/DONUT/logs and /reports
end note

if (Artifacts copied?) then (yes)
    :Parse report (XML / JSON / CSV);
    :Return Success + result;
else (no)
    :Log error + return Failure;
endif

stop
@enduml
